This is an unofficial fork. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Qwen
team or Alibaba; upstream names are used only to identify its origin.

Changes made to the upstream files (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)); the exact list is
`git diff --name-only <upstream-tag>..HEAD`:

- Telemetry removed: no @opentelemetry/* dependencies; telemetry modules are
  no-op stubs; static installation id; auto-update and git co-author disabled.
- web_search uses SerpApi instead of upstream providers.
- Vision-bridge image conversion is throttled instead of capped per turn.
- Remote artifact publishing is locked to local and always asks for approval.
- Optional append-only auto-memory (QWEN_MEMORY_APPEND_ONLY=1).
- Extra context and prompt-cache status-line items.
- Resumed-session prelude reuse when a rebuild proves it unchanged.
- Tool-result clearing on idle is off by default.
- Main-chat tool declarations are built outside agent frames.
- Fork README, install scripts and documentation.
